<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Jan-July 96 trade deficit $1,438 mln.</title>
<headline>Hungary Jan-July 96 trade deficit $1,438 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's foreign trade deficit amounted to an accumulated $1,438 million in January-July 1996, down from $1,647 million in the same period of 1995, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Monday.  </p>
<p>  ($ million)    July 96   June 96    Jan-July 96  Jan-July 95</p>
<p>  Exports	  1,151     1,149	 7,919	  6,725</p>
<p>  Imports	  1,396     1,409	 9,357	  8,372</p>
<p>  Trade balance  - 244     - 259	-1,438	 -1,647</p>
<p>NOTE - The NBH's trade figures are based on cash flows.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
